風與光 · OF WIND AND LIGHT — third-party material in this film

FOOTAGE
  11 clips supplied by the author of this film (not in git; put them in footage/ to rebuild). Cut, retimed, cropped and colour-graded.
  Several clips carry marks of the account "Earthcurated" / "Earthcurated Media"; the marks were cropped
  out of frame (rain street, pink dusk sky, stars over daisies) or removed with delogo (stormy cliff path).
  A faint mark remains in the highway clip (centre) and the blossom clip (upper left), too faint and too
  central to crop. The author is responsible for holding the rights to use this footage.

